# Transmutation Font: "Sacrifice three artifact tokens with different names" (CR 118.3, 601.2h): the three are chosen as a group whose names all differ, so two Bloods and a Clue
# are not enough. The Font makes a Blood on turn 1, another on turn 3 and a Clue on turn 5; on turn 7 the ability isn't offered, though three artifact tokens are there. The Font
# then makes a Food, and on turn 9, with two Bloods, a Clue and a Food, Bot1 pays: two Bloods and a Clue are refused by the cost's own question; a Blood, the Clue and the Food are
# sacrificed, and the other Blood stays. No artifact card is in the library, so nothing is found, and the library is shuffled all the same (CR 701.23b).

